## 2. Data Sources

The data in this repository was collected from the official documentation services (*Parlamentsdokumentation*) of the German state parliaments:

- Baden-Württemberg Landtag – https://www.landtag-bw.de  
- Berlin Abgeordnetenhaus – https://www.parlament-berlin.de  
- Brandenburg Landtag – https://www.landtag.brandenburg.de/  

